{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"091d503681e7d49e","x":-680,"y":720,"width":1300,"height":1440,"type":"group","label":"Delete feature"},
		{"id":"1d40c54cb329158c","type":"text","text":"Delete \nPayload - \n1. Type of Entity - \n\t1. Client\n\t2. Source\n\t3. Table\n\t4. Column\n\t5. Edge (Relationship)\n2. ID (document's id)\n3. ==Make sure to have list of ID's. Convert from string to list.==\nLogic -\n4. If type = \"source\":\n\t Delete the all tables and its columns\n5. If type = \"table\":\n\t Delete the all columns of given table and rewrite the table list of source metadata\n6. If type = \"column\":\n\t Delete the specific column and column list in table\n\t If the specified column is PK or FK then look for PKRT and FKRT. \n\nThings to look-up:\n1. Edges \n2. Relations \n\t1. PKRT\n\t2. FKRT\n3. Parent's node will contain the list of children so rewrite accordingly.\n\n\t\n","x":-403,"y":-140,"width":923,"height":720},
		{"id":"62a39d2b77bb98b2","type":"text","text":"![[Media.jpeg]]","x":680,"y":-280,"width":1051,"height":1380},
		{"id":"044fab13adae9ca0","type":"text","text":"Delete API\nPayload : Given above in detail.\n\nLogic :\n\n| Type   | What should be deleted                                                           |\n| ------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Source | 1. Source metadata document                                                      |\n|        | 2. Its all tables                                                                |\n|        | 3. All columns of that source                                                    |\n|        | 4. Edges - HAS_SOURCE, HAS_TABLE, HAS_COLUMNS Edges                              |\n|        | 5. Relationships -                                                               |\n|        | 5.1 PKRT of other table                                                          |\n|        | 5.2 FKRT of other table                                                          |\n|        | 6. Edges - HAS_FOREIGN_KEY, HAS_CROSS_REFERENCE                                  |\n|        | 7. Rewrite the embedding of Client metadata,                                     |\n|        | 8. Rewrite the table embedding which had CROSS_REFERNECE                         |\n|        | 9. Universal Metadata                                                            |\n|        | 10. DQ Rules                                                                     |\n|        | 11. Metrics                                                                      |\n|        | 12. so on                                                                        |\n|        |                                                                                  |\n| Table  | 1. Table metadata document                                                       |\n|        | 2. All columns document of that table                                            |\n|        | 3. Edges - HAS_TABLE, HAS_COLUMN                                                 |\n|        | 4. Relationships -                                                               |\n|        | 4.1 PKRT of other table across sources                                           |\n|        | 4.2 FKRT of other table across sources                                           |\n|        | 5. Edges - HAS_FORIEGN_KEY, HAS_CROSS_REFERNCE                                   |\n|        | 6. Rewrite the embedding of the parent source                                    |\n|        | 7. Rewrite the table embedding which had HAS_CROSS_REFERENCE and HAS_FOREIGN_KEY |\n|        | 8. Universal metadata                                                            |\n|        | 9. DQ Rule                                                                       |\n|        | 10. so on                                                                        |\n|        |                                                                                  |\n| Column | 1. Column metadata document                                                      |\n|        | 2. Edges - HAS_COLUMNS                                                           |\n|        | 3. If given column is PK or FK of parent table -                                 |\n|        | 3.1 Remove the column from PK or FK list                                         |\n|        | 3.2 Remove the column from PKRT of FKRT list                                     |\n|        | 3.3 Remove the PKRT or FKRT of other table                                       |\n|        | 3.4 Edges - HAS_FOREIGN_KEY, HAS_CROSS_REFERENCE                                 |\n|        | 4. Rewrite the table metadata embeddings                                         |\n|        | 5. Rewrite the corresponding tables metadata                                     |\n|        | 6. Universal metadata                                                            |\n|        | 7. DQ Rule                                                                       |\n|        | 8. Metrics                                                                       |\n|        | 9. so on                                                                         |\n\n","x":-660,"y":740,"width":799,"height":1400},
		{"id":"a15dbdbd01519095","x":160,"y":1240,"width":120,"height":160,"color":"1","type":"text","text":"S1 t1 \n\nc1 pk\nc2 fk \nc3 fk"},
		{"id":"beaef1a47e5b2379","type":"text","text":"S2 t2\n\nc2 pk \npkrt to table t1 delete\n\nc1 fk \nfkrt to table t1 delete\n","x":300,"y":1240,"width":300,"height":195}
	],
	"edges":[]
}